# "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard this card, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it
# into your graveyard." A spell as well as an ability: Bot2's Thoughtseize on turn 2 picks the Wilt-Leaf Liege out of Bot1's hand,
# and Bot1 discards it onto the battlefield under its own control, not into its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Wilt-Leaf Liege
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Thoughtseize
Island x18

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(Wilt-Leaf Liege)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Wilt-Leaf Liege
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Thoughtseize
Bot2.Life = 18
